# The image build needs only pyproject.toml, uv.lock, README.md, LICENSE, CHANGELOG.md and src/.
# Everything below is excluded so the context stays small and no local secret can enter it.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md
!src/
!plugins/
plugins/**
!plugins/yandex-360/
!plugins/yandex-360/skills/
!plugins/yandex-360/skills/*/
!plugins/yandex-360/skills/*/SKILL.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
